{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"“整体截面”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"整体截面"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"层","text":"层"}},{"Plain":"的整体截面是整个空间上的截面, 等于到一个点 ("},{"Local":{"url":"终对象","text":"终对象"}},{"Plain":") 的态射的"},{"Local":{"url":"直像","text":"直像"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>整体截面是<strong>左正合</strong>函子, 其右"},{"Local":{"url":"导出函子","text":"导出函子"}},{"Plain":"给出 (Abel 层的) "},{"Local":{"url":"层上同调","text":"层上同调"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}